    fix(docs): mark export pr_url as reserved and never populated. Addresses DF-OFF-BY-ONE-40.
    
    PRURL has no assignment site and internal/export has no pull-request
    creation, so the old claim that pr_url is "omitted when the repo does not
    support pull requests" implied a population path that cannot exist.
    docs/api-reference.md, docs/integration.md and pkg/api/openapi.yaml now
    state the field is reserved and never populated; the JSON field stays in
    the schema (omitempty) as the least-breaking contract. Adds focused
    regression tests pinning the reserved wording in the served spec and
    blocking the misleading conditional-population sentence from returning.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
